usage: main.py [-h] --thread-id THREAD_ID [--database-url DATABASE_URL]
               [-o OUTPUT]
               resume job

Compare a resume with a job description using the job agent.

positional arguments:
  resume                Path to a UTF-8 resume text file.
  job                   Path to a UTF-8 job-description text file.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --thread-id THREAD_ID
                        Unique persistent run ID, for example application-001.
  --database-url DATABASE_URL
                        Override the application database URL.
  -o, --output OUTPUT   Write the JSON result to this file instead of standard
                        output.
